# Hydrofit.do Web

This project is the Next.js companion. It uses the same HydroFit tokens, stores, and services as the Android app.

Before editing `.ts` / `.tsx`, read `.cursor/skills/hydrofit-code-standards/SKILL.md`.

On the web:

1. Colors still come from `src/theme/colors.ts`. Page CSS should use the variables `ThemeRoot` publishes (`--hf-*`, `--bg`, `--surface`, `--primary`). Do not add new hex values in components.
2. Spacing still comes from `src/theme/spacing.ts`.
3. Fonts are Inter and Sora from `public/fonts`, loaded with `next/font/local`.
4. UI is HTML, SVG, and CSS. Do not import `react-native` or other React Native packages. Browser storage, notifications, and ads go through `src/stores` and `src/core`.
5. Persistence goes through the Zustand stores in `src/stores`.
